<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>go-authn – Secrets</title><link>https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/tags/secrets/</link><description>Recent content in Secrets on go-authn</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/tags/secrets/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>secretsource — a secret from a reference</title><link>https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/libraries/secretsource/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/libraries/secretsource/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where does a PIN come from, when it must not sit in a file?&lt;/strong&gt; A &lt;strong&gt;reference&lt;/strong&gt;
names where a secret lives; &lt;code&gt;secretsource.Open&lt;/code&gt; fetches it. The reference holds
no secret, so it may sit in a flag, a script or a shell history.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;go get github.com/go-authn/secretsource@v0.6.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;secretsource&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;Open&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;ctx&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;keepassxc:https://fido.invalid/yubikey-5c&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;!=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kc"&gt;nil&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;defer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;Close&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// overwrites the bytes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;use&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;Bytes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;())&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Reference&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Reads&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;file:PATH&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;a regular file readable by its owner alone (mode 0600 or stricter); one trailing newline is stripped; a file that is empty, or holds only a line ending, is refused with &lt;code&gt;ErrEmpty&lt;/code&gt; (since v0.6.0), and a FIFO is refused as not a regular file&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;keychain:SERVICE/ACCOUNT&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;a macOS Keychain generic-password item&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;secretservice:SERVICE/ACCOUNT&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;a freedesktop Secret Service item with attributes &lt;code&gt;service=SERVICE&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;account=ACCOUNT&lt;/code&gt; (GNOME Keyring, KWallet, KeePassXC&amp;rsquo;s Secret Service integration)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;secretservice:KEY=VALUE[,KEY=VALUE...]&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;the one Secret Service item carrying all those attributes; several matches are refused&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;keepassxc:URL&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;the KeePassXC entry whose &lt;strong&gt;URL field&lt;/strong&gt; is that URL (&lt;code&gt;https://NAME.invalid/...&lt;/code&gt; is a good, never-resolving choice); two entries with the same URL are refused as ambiguous&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;keepassxc:by-uuid/...&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;keepassxc:by-path/...&lt;/code&gt; are &lt;strong&gt;refused&lt;/strong&gt;: KeePassXC
2.8.0 crashes when a lookup finds an entry with no URL.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No scheme runs a command&lt;/strong&gt;: a flag must never be able to start a process. A
reference with no scheme is refused, not guessed to be a path (&lt;code&gt;file:&lt;/code&gt; is how a
path is written). A secret longer than 4096 bytes, or an empty one from a
manager or a &lt;code&gt;file:&lt;/code&gt;, is refused (&lt;code&gt;ErrEmpty&lt;/code&gt;), and a call ends with its context (2 minutes when it has no
deadline) even while the manager waits for you to unlock it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="keepassxc"&gt;KeePassXC&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="keepassxc"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#keepassxc" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;KeePassXC is reached through its browser-integration protocol, on macOS and
Linux; Windows is not implemented yet. Since v0.6.0, on Unix, the socket is
refused when it is a symbolic link or when its directory is owned by another user
or writable by group or others, and the uid of the connected peer is checked after
the dial; the legacy &lt;code&gt;$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/org.keepassxc.KeePassXC.BrowserServer&lt;/code&gt;
symlink is no longer followed (the real socket under &lt;code&gt;app/org.keepassxc.KeePassXC/&lt;/code&gt;
is).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In KeePassXC, enable &lt;em&gt;Settings &amp;gt; Browser Integration&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Associate this machine once per database, and approve it in KeePassXC:
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;go install github.com/go-authn/secretsource/cmd/secretsource@latest
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;secretsource keepassxc associate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create the entry and &lt;strong&gt;fill its URL field&lt;/strong&gt; with&lt;code&gt;https://fido.invalid/yubikey-5c&lt;/code&gt; (any URL no other entry uses: the
reference is that URL). Check the reference without printing the secret:
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;secretsource check &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;keepassxc:https://fido.invalid/yubikey-5c&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The first read of an entry shows KeePassXC&amp;rsquo;s access dialog.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Used by &lt;code&gt;fido --pin-from&lt;/code&gt; (see &lt;a href="https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/libraries/fido/"&gt;fido&lt;/a&gt;) and
by &lt;code&gt;theca --pin-from&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;--password-from&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;--recovery-from&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="store"&gt;Storing a secret: &lt;code&gt;secretsource store&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="store"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#store" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;No entry has to be made by hand. &lt;code&gt;secretsource store REF [--group G] [--login L] [--replace] [--generate N]&lt;/code&gt; writes the secret for &lt;code&gt;keychain:&lt;/code&gt;,&lt;code&gt;secretservice:SERVICE/ACCOUNT&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;secretservice:KEY=VALUE&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;keepassxc:URL&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;secretsource store &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;keepassxc:https://fido.invalid/yubikey-5c&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;secretsource store &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;keepassxc:https://fido.invalid/yubikey-5c&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; --generate &lt;span class="m"&gt;24&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;printf&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;%s&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;$PIN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; secretsource store keychain:fido/yubikey-5c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The secret is typed twice with echo off, or read from standard input when that
is not a terminal; it is never taken from an argument or the environment.&lt;code&gt;--generate N&lt;/code&gt; draws N letters and digits and prints nothing secret. An
existing entry is refused unless &lt;code&gt;--replace&lt;/code&gt; (for KeePassXC that updates that
entry, found by its URL). &lt;code&gt;file:&lt;/code&gt; is refused.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For &lt;code&gt;keepassxc:&lt;/code&gt; it uses the browser protocol&amp;rsquo;s &lt;code&gt;set-login&lt;/code&gt;, so the entry always
carries the URL that finds it again, and a duplicate is looked up by URL. The
login defaults to the URL&amp;rsquo;s host (&lt;code&gt;--login&lt;/code&gt;), the group is &lt;code&gt;KeePassXC-Browser Passwords&lt;/code&gt; unless &lt;code&gt;--group&lt;/code&gt; names one below the root, and &lt;code&gt;--title&lt;/code&gt; is refused
because KeePassXC 2.8.0 ignores it. KeePassXC shows its own dialogs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="reference"&gt;Reference&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="reference"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#reference" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The README at&lt;a href="https://github.com/go-authn/secretsource" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;github.com/go-authn/secretsource&lt;/a&gt; is
the source of truth for this page.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>